The MiMo attention and routing implementation in src/transformer.zig follows
the reference's partial rotary embedding, asymmetric K/V, attention-sink,
value-scaling and sigmoid-routing contracts. It is implemented in Zig against
mlx-c with SSD-streamed expert banks. tests/dump_mimo_v2_fixtures.py loads the
unmodified reference externally to generate independent numerical fixtures.

