The MiMo-ViT vision tower in `src/mimo_vision.zig` is a port of the
reference's `MiMoVisionTransformer` (`modeling_mimo_v2.py`), and its image
preprocessing follows the vendor serving processors (`smart_resize`, bilinear
resampling, ImageNet normalization). The three MTP heads in `src/mimo_mtp.zig`
follow the MiMo-V2 MTP layer as XiaomiMiMo's vLLM and SGLang integrations
compose it (Apache-2.0). Both are reimplemented in Zig against mlx-c;
tests/dump_mimo_vision_fixtures.py and tests/dump_mimo_v2_mtp_fixtures.py
render their fixtures from the unmodified reference modules.

`src/fixtures/mimo_v26_chat_template.jinja` is the checkpoint's
`chat_template` from tokenizer_config.json, unmodified, used as a test
fixture; the model repository declares it under the MIT License.

